Subject: [PATCH 41/50] B70-V32-02: per-step GPU/host phase timing in the V2
 runner (diagnostic, B70_PHASE_TIMING=1)

Timing events (resolved by query, never synchronized) at exec/fwd/sample/post/draft/kvpost/end;
rank 0 logs medians every B70_PHASE_TIMING_EVERY steps. Off by default.
